/*
 * lib/cpu/amd-epyc/SLAMDEPYC9575F.sleela
 * SLeeLa Standard Library Definition.
 * Definition: AMD EPYC 9575F (Zen 5 "Turin", 9005 F-series high-frequency).
 *   64 cores / 128 threads, 3.3 GHz base / 5.0 GHz max boost, 256 MB L3,
 *   12-channel DDR5, SP5, ~400 W. The high-frequency GPU-host part. A thin SKU
 *   subclass of SLAMDEPYCCPU overriding only configure(). Full figures in
